{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach and take it. If not, scan for it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInReach    /> <SubTree ID = FindAndTakeObject    />\"",
